Package: zuspark
Title: Native Client for 'Spark Connect'
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Pedro", "Baltazar", , "pedrobtz@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph")),
    person("The Apache Software Foundation", role = "cph",
           comment = "Spark Connect protocol definitions in inst/proto"),
    person("Google LLC", role = "cph",
           comment = "google/rpc protocol definitions in inst/proto")
    )
Description: Connects to a 'Spark Connect' endpoint, runs 'Spark SQL'
    statements there and returns the results as 'Arrow' data or data
    frames, without a 'Java' virtual machine, 'Python' or a 'Spark'
    installation. Speaks the 'Spark Connect' protocol itself, in 'R': 'gRPC'
    calls through 'zugrpc', protocol buffer messages through 'zuproto' and
    'Arrow' record batches through 'zuarrow'.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://pedrobtz.github.io/zuspark/
Encoding: UTF-8
Language: en-GB
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1)
Imports:
    stats,
    zuproto (>= 0.1.0)
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Remotes:
    pedrobtz/zuproto
